Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time the rain no longer falls, and\NI see the sky, I think there's a light.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.98,0:00:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to when I was a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.36,0:00:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could only cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.02,0:00:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Blindly chasing after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.58,0:00:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell far behind my only thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.38,0:00:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,One day I will be stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.44,0:00:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Bridery and gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Fading with the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.60,0:00:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I stronger now than I was before?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.40,0:00:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Or as weak as back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.38,0:00:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.44,0:01:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But until I do, my voyage will not end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.24,0:01:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what's next, I'm\Nwalking straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.88,0:01:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go, there's nothing\Nthat can stop us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.64,0:01:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Though time's all on our side,\Nwe'll never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall, but we'll\Nalways keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.68,0:01:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything will take\Nwhat I hold dear away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.80,0:01:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The voices inside me push\Nme to keep surviving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go on. I'll get through.\NNo matter what I gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.34,0:01:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The fiercest of all can pour upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.26,0:01:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care why in the\Nworld would I turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.22,0:01:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.32,0:01:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing that can stop us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.98,0:02:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Though time's not on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.26,0:02:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.92,0:02:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But we'll always keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.90,0:02:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything Will take\Nwhat I hold dear away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.16,0:02:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the future's there for us to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.48,0:02:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I'm a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.04,0:02:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, doctor, my ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.80,0:02:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of doctor carries a giant sword
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.18,0:02:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and the whole submarine\Nthing is fishy too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.60,0:02:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your deal? Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.54,0:02:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Another pirate crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.94,0:02:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Trafalgar Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.22,0:02:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, he's a rookie from the north blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.38,0:02:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he must be Straw Hat's accomplice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.78,0:02:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The two start trouble with the\Ncelestial dragons on Sabahodian.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.38,0:02:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,While back, but we weren't\Nable to capture either of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.90,0:02:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's quite dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.10,0:02:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be planning\Nto escape by submarine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.64,0:02:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop screwing around! Head him over!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.66,0:03:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What's in it for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.90,0:03:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What's in it for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.16,0:03:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.92,0:03:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Law?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.83,0:03:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Navy battleships are approaching for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.66,0:03:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,the stern.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.57,0:03:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it. There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.50,0:03:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta escape now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.58,0:03:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare for combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.38,0:03:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Team A will
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.58,0:03:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,pursue the Whitebeard Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.38,0:03:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Team B will stop Blackbeard\Nand his crew at any cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.60,0:03:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Reinforcements are coming\Nfrom underground. Do
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.50,0:03:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,they ever stop finally\Nnow let's rush them down
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.40,0:04:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait. Now what? Not again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.20,0:04:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.20,0:04:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta admit, it's pretty fun to watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.86,0:04:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't forget about me, did\Nyou? Clown, you forget about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.34,0:04:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,another fabulous show though\Na bit close for comfort
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.50,0:04:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, yeah, power's not\Nan issue, but control is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.68,0:04:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,tricky you're not kidding\Nif you're gonna sink this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.26,0:04:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,place at least wait until\Nwe're not standing on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.44,0:05:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop this! It's madness!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.24,0:05:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Not enough that you killed\NWhitebeard in cold blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.18,0:05:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're abusing his\Npower and putting his
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.52,0:05:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,own crew members at\Nrisk with this nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.08,0:05:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.99,0:05:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to nag me to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.64,0:05:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't play nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.38,0:05:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Those days are as dead\Nand gone as Whitebeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.16,0:05:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No one should have that much power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.22,0:05:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.14,0:05:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.36,0:05:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.54,0:05:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a warning from the Zeff Odi\NArchipelago Emergency Broadcast System.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.54,0:05:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Following an earthquake at Marineford,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.44,0:05:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,a tsunami is expected to\Nhit our southern shores.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.96,0:05:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone please remain calm and listen
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.80,0:05:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,carefully for the following\Nsafety instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.42,0:05:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Those in groves 1 through\N39 should relocate to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.22,0:05:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,the elevated northern\Ngroves of 40 through 50.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.46,0:05:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Boobit, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.24,0:06:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a nobleman, i'll pay good\Nmoney if you let me go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.10,0:06:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Please proceed in an orderly fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.48,0:06:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Those weird robots are crawling\Nover the crack in the plaza.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.46,0:06:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, move, follow the\Npacifistas and open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.46,0:06:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.82,0:06:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I got this, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.92,0:06:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You two go on ahead without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.74,0:06:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck is going on with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.16,0:06:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.62,0:06:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There's too much sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.42,0:06:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.66,0:07:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There are all these voices in my head, but\NI can feel them disappearing one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.60,0:07:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Voices?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.64,0:07:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll show you the meaning of justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.48,0:07:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.39,0:07:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's for my friend, you damn murderer!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.82,0:07:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for your\Ncrimes and blood, scumbag!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.84,0:07:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sending a message, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.48,0:07:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We rule this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.68,0:07:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Order rules this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.46,0:07:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Got one!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.74,0:07:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I know we're all stressed out right\Nnow, but you're losing your mind here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.90,0:07:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.42,0:07:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! Somebody help! I can't\Nmake it! I can't make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.60,0:07:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Kobe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.92,0:07:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.16,0:07:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't run from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.40,0:08:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not losing anymore,\Nokay? Now stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.52,0:08:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.66,0:08:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be fine! Hear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.98,0:08:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.08,0:08:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.99,0:08:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not done fighting,\Ndammit! But, sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.28,0:08:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The pirates are escaping!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.80,0:08:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Our job is to enforce justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.32,0:08:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have time to\Ntend to the wounded. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.62,0:08:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.40,0:08:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill every last one of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.64,0:08:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Show the world what\Nhappens when you defy us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.16,0:08:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a man down! Medic!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.44,0:08:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.12,0:08:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just shoot one and move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.78,0:08:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not about winning anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.94,0:08:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They're bloodthirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.52,0:08:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They want revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.50,0:08:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It went straight through him! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.28,0:08:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Chase them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.30,0:08:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.54,0:08:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if our enemies are\Ncriminals, this isn't justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.96,0:08:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Their wrongs don't make us right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.66,0:09:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're a marine, then follow my lead\Nand strike them down with no mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.50,0:09:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Funny, I don't see anyone stopping me or\Neven trying. Are you navy boys scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.58,0:09:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me friend but why don't\Nyou come on down here no not you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.58,0:09:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Kizaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.49,0:09:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Chop them now, you idiot!\NYou know what? Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.46,0:09:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need this right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.06,0:09:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've done enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.10,0:09:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They're probably gonna die anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.56,0:09:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,John Bart! Here they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.46,0:09:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, nice catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.08,0:09:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, now submerge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.88,0:09:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think I forgot about\Nwhat happened on Sabaody.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.38,0:09:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.12,0:09:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.06,0:10:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,These wounds are pretty\Nbad! Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.94,0:10:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Temp, time to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.64,0:10:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.30,0:10:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.14,0:10:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A marine?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.90,0:10:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Kobe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.81,0:10:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point in fighting anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.44,0:10:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point in killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.88,0:10:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over. We won.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.64,0:10:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We can happen. This?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.26,0:10:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.72,0:10:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.92,0:10:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Please someone help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.26,0:10:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,These are human lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.98,0:10:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.94,0:10:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They have families, children.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.88,0:10:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They're our friends and\Nwe're watching them die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.52,0:10:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We killed Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.18,0:10:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.46,0:10:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The pirates don't have\Nthe will to fight anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.84,0:11:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we trying to prove?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.64,0:11:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.12,0:11:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There are wounded men out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.24,0:11:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We can save them if we stop fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.50,0:11:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But no, we're just making\Nmore victims, more casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.42,0:11:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Those marines have nothing to be proud of.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.42,0:11:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.24,0:11:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they dying?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.82,0:11:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they even fighting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.98,0:11:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, you better run.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.58,0:11:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wasting my time if you would\Nimpede justice. I have no use for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.42,0:11:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Not exactly what I'd hoped for but\Nat least I said what I had to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.62,0:11:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.32,0:12:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A splendid speech touched\Nmy heart and though
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.30,0:12:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,they were few those\Nprecious moments of courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.14,0:12:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You showed will change\Nthis world though only the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.58,0:12:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,future will tell if it's for\Nthe better or for the worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.56,0:12:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside, I'll be right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.88,0:12:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.96,0:12:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Put your hands up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.22,0:12:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh I'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.58,0:12:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ben Beckman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.02,0:12:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.50,0:12:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.10,0:12:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.14,0:12:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.32,0:12:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the four emperors and his crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.04,0:12:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's redhead shakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.94,0:12:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,On the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.92,0:12:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time, old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.38,0:13:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's end this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.58,0:13:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Shanks, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.96,0:13:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The bastard who turned my\Ngrandson into a damn pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.54,0:13:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole red hair crew showed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.02,0:13:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.26,0:13:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,His crew had a run-in with one of\Nthe other emperors just yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.94,0:13:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought he and Kaido would\Nstill be duking it out for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.10,0:13:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's he doing all the way over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.36,0:14:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Shakes? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.96,0:14:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I got enough going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.64,0:14:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.22,0:14:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Buggy catch your hat give\Nit back to Luffy for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.26,0:14:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you do it? I've\Nbeen holding on to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.56,0:14:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,treasure map for a while\Nhoping I'd bump into you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.20,0:14:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Treasure map and I guarantee\Nit'll suit your fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.44,0:14:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh really, I'm supposed to\Nbelieve we're such good pals.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.84,0:14:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,that you'll give me a\Ntreasure map over a dumb hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.02,0:14:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well I can always\Ngive it to someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.60,0:14:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so hasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.40,0:14:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it for old life's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.92,0:14:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure about this? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.10,0:14:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't seen Luffy in ten whole years.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.76,0:14:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You gonna let him leave without saying hi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.46,0:14:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.37,0:14:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been that long, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.16,0:14:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.12,0:14:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.24,0:15:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this is cool to watch it\Nall, but we're going underwater!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.52,0:15:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.94,0:15:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.18,0:15:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No we're gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.20,0:15:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Here Straw Hat forgot this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.94,0:15:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take it and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.20,0:15:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he throwing at us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.20,0:15:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.48,0:15:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay okay you got the hat or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.82,0:15:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come on hurry up. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.82,0:15:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still too soon. I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.38,0:15:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave this hat to you. I want you\Nto bring this hat back to me someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.26,0:15:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,In good condition and\Nonly once you've become
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.88,0:15:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,a great pirate that's our promise Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.64,0:16:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.32,0:16:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And that means I can't see you yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.70,0:16:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.60,0:16:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All right Shall we begin?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.70,0:16:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be a fun operation, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.64,0:16:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Stop them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.84,0:16:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Do whatever it takes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.80,0:16:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ice age!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.12,0:16:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They're after the submarine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.40,0:17:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole sea is freezing over!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.42,0:17:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking good. His pulse is steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.64,0:17:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that I don't know what happened\Nbut the water around us is turning to ice?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.08,0:17:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We're diving deeper. Full speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.34,0:17:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.26,0:17:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, no more stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.72,0:17:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Yasakani's sacred show.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.36,0:18:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.66,0:18:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Going deeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.18,0:18:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.72,0:18:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We got lucky once, but we're done for sure\Nthis time. We'll be fine. Keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.38,0:18:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez, can't they just give it up already?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.90,0:18:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, he didn't hit them, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.94,0:18:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't die down there! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.50,0:18:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If they're still alive after that,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.10,0:18:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid Lady Luck\Njust isn't on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.34,0:18:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we can't sink them\Ntoday, we'll sink them tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.06,0:18:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's one of our ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.02,0:18:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it taking off on its own?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.70,0:19:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.64,0:19:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow that submarine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.72,0:19:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, but I mean, it's already underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.26,0:19:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, I'm pretty sure everyone on it is\Ndead after those attacks from the Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.76,0:19:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.67,0:19:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.96,0:19:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.24,0:19:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With my authority as a warlord of the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.08,0:19:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall pursue and\Ncapture Straw Hat Luffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.98,0:19:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter the cost!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.76,0:19:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.64,0:19:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great, but, like, how?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.32,0:19:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Just shut up and go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.18,0:19:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.09,0:19:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so hot when she yells at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.74,0:19:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You scum-sucking red-haired\Nsack of excrement!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.08,0:19:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me the\Ntreasure map thing was a lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.98,0:19:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just having some fun, old friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.78,0:19:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.86,0:19:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.54,0:19:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.94,0:20:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you think that I'd forgive\Nyou for what you did out of kindness?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.28,0:20:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That I'd forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.66,0:20:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.80,0:20:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.90,0:20:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't snuck up on me back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.48,0:20:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I never would have eaten that\NDevil Fruit and more importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.48,0:20:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I never would have lost that treasure map.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.42,0:20:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, I'd?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.76,0:20:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Be filthy rich instead\Nof running from the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.46,0:20:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.48,0:20:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Playing it cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.88,0:20:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.24,0:20:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,All these years and you're still a\Nprodigy when it comes to pissing me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.78,0:20:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You've hardly been here five minutes\Nand you've already lied and cheated me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.86,0:20:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you were going to stop the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.88,0:20:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you're about to start\Na new one with me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.04,0:20:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Once a chump, always a chump.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.90,0:20:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.90,0:20:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.81,0:20:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the emperors can't\Nescape his trash talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.16,0:20:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He's such a pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.16,0:21:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Back, could you be more perfect?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.50,0:21:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We will follow you to\Nthe end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.24,0:21:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I really did miss you though?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.08,0:21:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sure you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.58,0:21:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait, these guys\Nare certified badasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.68,0:21:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can catch a ride with my old Gourmet,\NI can get off this island scot-free.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.82,0:21:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.98,0:21:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Marco, there's nothing to\Ngain from fighting anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.14,0:21:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just walk away nice and easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.34,0:21:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hawkeye!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.28,0:21:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.14,0:21:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I agreed to fight Whitebeard\Nand his allies, true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.20,0:21:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But red hair is another matter entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.30,0:21:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You should quit as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.14,0:22:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your thirst for battle is your undoing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.88,0:22:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Every blow you land upon your\Nenemies, you land upon your own men.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.94,0:22:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,However, if anyone here\Nstill hungers for battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.86,0:22:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine then come we shall be\Nmore than happy to face you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.72,0:22:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, teach you what you want\Nto try. Sorry, Blackbeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.44,0:22:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty as a picture\Naren't you i got what i
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.48,0:22:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,came for here after all\Nand i'm not looking for
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.06,0:22:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,a fight With you guys\Nwell not yet at least
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.20,0:23:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, fellas, let's pack\Nit up. Zia-ha-ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.84,0:23:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.26,0:23:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Accept your losses.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.64,0:23:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Honor the fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.32,0:23:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Withdraw from battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.86,0:23:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,With your dignity intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.48,0:24:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.96,0:24:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's finally over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.44,0:24:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,As for Whitebeard and Ace,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.92,0:24:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you won't object to their\Nfriends taking care of the burial.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.10,0:24:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle was already\Nbroadcast to the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.12,0:24:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't allow you to make a\Nfurther spectacle of their
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.80,0:25:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,deaths by parading their\Ncorpses around like trophies.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.16,0:25:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And why shouldn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.86,0:25:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If they wanted a proper burial so badly,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.18,0:25:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,that perhaps they shouldn't\Nhave defied the navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.62,0:25:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We have every right to\Nstring the bastards up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.02,0:25:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And why should we listen\Nto a pirate anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.12,0:25:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.30,0:25:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We earned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.46,0:25:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.46,0:25:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.80,0:25:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll allow it, Shanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.98,0:25:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just this once. But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.30,0:25:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me take responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.82,0:25:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.36,0:25:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go treat the injured\Nbefore it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.76,0:25:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This war is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.38,0:25:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That Navy has won.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.20,0:25:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can help the medics, hop to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.70,0:26:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Get those with serious\Ninjuries out of here first.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.74,0:26:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We've seen enough suffering for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.78,0:26:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and I won't lose any more\Nmen. And thus what would later
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.90,0:26:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,be known as the war of the\Nbest ended in Marine Ford,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.48,0:26:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,the most fearsome battle since the\Nbeginning of the great pirate era,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.34,0:26:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,brought victories and defeats alike,\Nleaving the world uncertain of its future?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.42,0:26:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
